Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_81985c46-3ab2-3139-a642-3cc8844b2fcc.xml</text>
